'''Sir Rel''' (イングリッス, ''Ingurissu'') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] variant of [[Squire Rel]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 3's [[Zombie Outbreaks]]. He was added in [[Version 7.1 Update|Version 7.1]].

